### 4. 协议层安全方案完善

根据端侧 Agent 架构原则： **本地 IPC 优先，远程访问再补 TLS，各协议走原生安全通道** 。

#### 4.1 云端 LLM 调用（`core/llm/cloud_client.py`）

对外部网络调用强制 HTTPS：

```python:core/llm/cloud_client.py
    def _init_client(self):
        if self.api_base and not self.api_base.startswith("https://"):
            logger.warning("CloudClient: forcing HTTPS for external API call")
            self.api_base = self.api_base.replace("http://", "https://", 1)
        # 使用 https://urllib3 对外部调用进行 TLS 验证
```

#### 4.2 MQTT → MQTTS（`core/protocols/smart_home_gateway.py`）

```python:core/protocols/smart_home_gateway.py
class MQTTProtocol(ProtocolInterface):
    def __init__(self, broker: str = "192.168.1.100", port: int = 1883,
                 username: str = "", password: str = "", use_tls: bool = False,
                 cert_path: str = ""):
        self.port = 8883 if use_tls else 1883  # MQTTS 默认端口
        self.use_tls = use_tls
        self.cert_path = cert_path
        # ...
```

在配置中增加 `use_tls` 和 `cert_path` 选项。

#### 4.3 HomeAssistant → HTTPS（`core/protocols/smart_home_gateway.py`）

```python:core/protocols/smart_home_gateway.py
class HomeAssistantProtocol(ProtocolInterface):
    def __init__(self, url: str = "https://192.168.1.200:8123", token: str = ""):
        self.url = url.rstrip("/")
        if not self.url.startswith("https://"):
            logger.warning("[HomeAssistant] Forcing HTTPS")
            self.url = self.url.replace("http://", "https://", 1)
```

